    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2018-hcn2-14: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.61";
    dc:description "Learning is explicitly operationalized by a standardized avoidance assay, so the claim is empirically clean. The necessary individual trial records are not named as public, and aggregate percentages alone cannot audit classification or acquisition dynamics.";
