    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Using trial-level red-light assay trajectories, apply a prespecified learning criterion to control, nicotine, and nicotine-plus-HCN2 tadpoles and compare learning proportions and acquisition curves.";
